// independently cross-checked byte-for-byte against the OpenSSL CLI
// (`openssl ec`, `openssl pkcs8 -topk8`) directly. The generator-point
// vector's public key also matches the published NIST P-256 base point
// (Gx/Gy from SEC 2 / FIPS 186-4).
// ============================================================

